msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "機能の互換性 {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the selected feature:\n"
msgstr "特定のランタイム機能は、単一のジョブ内では一緒に使用できません。互換性のない機能のリストを確認するには、適切なタブをクリックしてください：\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Might not work when using custom gates. Incompatible with:\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"分数ゲート\">\n"
"    次のものとは互換性がありません：\n"
"  - ゲートtwirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"ゲートフォールディングZNE\">\n"
"    カスタムゲートを使用すると動作しない場合があります。次のものとは互換性がありません：\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"ゲートtwirling\">\n"
"    次のものとは互換性がありません：\n"
"  - 分数ゲート\n"
"  - ストレッチ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
